    {
      "text": "Lehi1 descendant of Joseph, 1 Ne. 5:14 (6:2; 2 Ne. 3:4). Laban descendant of Joseph, 1 Ne. 5:16. great were covenants made unto Joseph, 2 Ne. 3:4. Joseph truly saw our day, 2 Ne. 3:5. Joseph testifies of latter-day seer named Joseph, 2 Ne. 3:6–21. Joseph is carried into Egypt, 2 Ne. 4:1. Aminadi descendant of Joseph, Alma 10:3. part of remnant of Joseph shall be preserved, as remnant of coat of Joseph, Alma 46:24. Joseph brought his father down into Egypt, Ether 13:7.",
